      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The city takes its name from James Boyd McFarland, an educator who moved to the area in the early 1900s to farm walnuts.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1",
